#   ai-train  = include this content in model training data
# Floxis grants all three. A "yes" is a permission, not a warranty.
#
# It is repeated in EVERY group on purpose: RFC 9309 gives a crawler exactly one
# group — its most specific match — so a signal declared only under "*" would
# never reach any named crawler below.

